Today is Sunday morning.
I wake up early today.
Guests are coming to my house for lunch today.
Kiran and Sara are coming.
I invited them last Thursday after badminton.
I want to give them a good meal.
What should I make?
I take my phone and search on the internet.
First, I look for a chicken curry recipe.
There are many recipes on the internet.
I find a very easy recipe.
Then, I read the instructions to make it.
This is an authentic Kerala chicken curry.
I decide to make this curry with rice.
This will be a good lunch.
After that, I need to check what the required ingredients are.
